  "description": "The Kent MTX series is designed specifically for young riders ages 6-14+, with sizes ranging from 20\" to 27.5\". Each bike features a lightweight alloy frame, kid-focused geometry, and durable components built to handle both neighborhood rides and off-road trails. Easy to use twist shifters and an 8 speed drivetrain give kids the right gear for every adventure, while wide handlebars, shorter reach, and powerful brakes provide stability and confidence. Smaller models (20\" and 24\") use dependable linear V-Brakes, while larger sizes (26\" and 27.5\") upgrade to mechanical disc brakes for even more stopping power. With rust-resistant parts, quick release hubs and seat posts for easy adjustments, and rugged all-terrain tires, Kent MTX bikes combine convenience for parents with performance kids will love. Whether it's the first real mountain bike or a step up to bigger adventures, MTX delivers thoughtful design in every detail.",
